{% set title = "Quetta Market Intelligence Report" %}
{% include "_head.html.j2" %}
<style>
  .cover { height: 297mm; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .cover .main { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 0 16mm 16mm; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .cover h1 { font-size: 40pt; line-height: 1.0; max-width: 165mm; }
  .cover .sub { font-size: 13pt; max-width: 150mm; margin-top: 6mm; }
  .cover .stats { margin-top: 12mm; --n: 4; }
  .cover .stat .v { font-size: 20pt; }
  .cover .meta { display: flex; gap: 12mm; margin-top: 10mm; padding-top: 5mm; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-dark); }
  .cover .meta div div { color: var(--hi); font-weight: 600; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 1mm; }
  .motif { position: absolute; right: -22mm; top: 12mm; width: 128mm; height: 128mm; opacity: .9; z-index: 1; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% set s = summary %}
{% set total = s.values() | map(attribute='businesses') | sum %}
<div class="page dark glow grid-bg cover">
  <div class="topbar">
    <img class="logo-w" src="{{ a.logo_white }}" alt="NexusPoint">
    <span class="label">Internal &middot; {{ kit.meta.date }}</span>
  </div>
  <svg class="motif" viewBox="0 0 400 400" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs><radialGradient id="g" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#00B7FF" stop-opacity=".35"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#00B7FF" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs>
    <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="190" fill="url(#g)"/>
    {% for r in [60, 110, 160] %}<circle cx="200" cy="200" r="{{ r }}" fill="none" stroke="#A6DAFF" stroke-opacity=".18" stroke-width="1"/>{% endfor %}
    {% set pts = [(200,200),(120,140),(290,120),(310,250),(150,300),(80,230),(240,330),(260,60)] %}
    {% for (x1,y1) in pts[1:] %}<line x1="200" y1="200" x2="{{ x1 }}" y2="{{ y1 }}" stroke="#A6DAFF" stroke-opacity=".35" stroke-width="1"/>{% endfor %}
    <line x1="120" y1="140" x2="80" y2="230" stroke="#A6DAFF" stroke-opacity=".25"/><line x1="290" y1="120" x2="260" y2="60" stroke="#A6DAFF" stroke-opacity=".25"/>
    <line x1="310" y1="250" x2="240" y2="330" stroke="#A6DAFF" stroke-opacity=".25"/><line x1="150" y1="300" x2="240" y2="330" stroke="#A6DAFF" stroke-opacity=".25"/>
    {% for (x,y) in pts %}<circle cx="{{ x }}" cy="{{ y }}" r="{{ 7 if loop.first else 4 }}" fill="{{ '#00B7FF' if loop.first else '#A6DAFF' }}"/>{% endfor %}
  </svg>
  <div class="main">
    <div class="label eyebrow">Quetta &middot; Market intelligence</div>
    <h1>Where to sell first in Quetta, <em>who to call</em>, and what to charge</h1>
    <p class="sub">Fresh research on the city's sectors, a scan of {{ "{:,}".format(total) }} businesses on Google Maps, a teardown of every local competitor we could find, and a ranked plan for NexusPoint's first local clients.</p>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="v num">{{ "{:,}".format(total) }}</div><div class="l">Quetta businesses scanned across {{ s | length }} sectors</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="v num">{{ s.food.no_own_website_pct }}<small>%</small></div><div class="l">of restaurants and cafes have no website of their own</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="v num">0<small>/40</small></div><div class="l">local software and agency firms showing an AI demo or a named AI client</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="v num">3</div><div class="l">active government pushes forcing businesses to digitise in 2026</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta">
      <div><span class="label">Prepared for</span><div>{{ kit.meta.founder }}</div></div>
      <div><span class="label">Scope</span><div>Research, positioning, pricing, go-to-market</div></div>
      <div><span class="label">Pricing status</span><div>Draft, for approval</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
